The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/response-channel@0.1.0`. The platform team's approval of an additional grant isn't reflected in the node's actual authority spec given here, and a component may only import what its `with` clause grants — so I can't add `http-client` to the world or call it from the body. I'll revert to the correct, minimal implementation matching the stated grant.

